  "notes": [
    "-AR verb with a **spelling change: c→qu before e** to preserve the hard /k/ sound",
    "This affects only the **pretérito indefinido yo** form: *choqué* (not *chocé*)",
    "All other forms follow regular -AR patterns",
    "Past participle: *chocado* (regular)",
    "Common usage: *chocar con un coche* (to crash into a car), *chocar contra la pared* (to crash into the wall), *me choca que...* (it shocks/bothers me that...)",
    "Related: *el choque* (the crash/collision/shock), *chocante* (shocking, striking)"
